From ab22753978989ba7c1c24279d3839c0225a0e72a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:10:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 36/57] Later evolutions: Weavile (proof of concept) and the
 Razor Claw

Weavile is a real species in an unused "old Unown" slot (no save layout
change): stats, abilities and learnsets from modern data; sprites, icon,
footprint and cry from pokeemerald-expansion; a Pokedex entry (Forest
habitat, shown as #461). Sneasel evolves with the new Razor Claw item
(used like a stone; holds as a Scope Lens), sold at Celadon Dept. Store
4F. Unown letters keep their own menu positions. Generated by
tools/hack/add_species.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
